  ('45e69e6f-969b-59b9-8a25-d31cfcbe1c86', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$In the second flight, the string feels "like a hand steadying its back" instead of "a leash." How does this change shape the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that the kite now flies higher than the clouds it envied at the beginning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It suggests that the kite will try to break free again as soon as the wind rises.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It shows the kite now sees the same limit as support rather than restraint.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that the girl has replaced the old string with a stronger and shorter one.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows the kite now sees the same limit as support rather than restraint.$q$, $q$The string is the same repaired string, but the kite's view of it changes from a leash to a steadying hand, completing the theme. The girl only reties the old string, so the replacement choice reads the image too literally.$q$, 'draft', '22ab2113-ca53-5255-9921-de940cc475f3')
