   $q$Which statement best expresses a central theme of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Students should not build apps until they have studied computer science in college.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Admitting a mistake openly can build trust and lead to better work.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Bus schedules change with the seasons, so riders should always check the time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-theme"},{"text":"It is usually wiser to fix problems quietly so that no one remembers them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Admitting a mistake openly can build trust and lead to better work.$q$, $q$Kofi's honest note brings helpful reports and wins back a user's trust. Lena's advice to fix things quietly is the view the story tests and rejects.$q$, 'draft', '8bbe8976-4d0e-56a2-b8c7-cd1ce5ac1fc1')
