   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Kofi's careless coding ruins the morning for twelve students, which shows he never should have shared the app.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"After Kofi fixes the bug, the transit agency hires him to rebuild its official schedule app for the city.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Kofi's friend Lena tells him that nobody reads update notes and that people remember announced mistakes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"When a bug in Kofi's bus app makes students miss a bus, he fixes it, explains the error publicly, and receives reports that help him improve.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$When a bug in Kofi's bus app makes students miss a bus, he fixes it, explains the error publicly, and receives reports that help him improve.$q$, $q$The correct summary covers the bug, the fix, the public note, and the useful responses in neutral terms. The first choice judges Kofi as careless, which an objective summary avoids.$q$, 'draft', '8bbe8976-4d0e-56a2-b8c7-cd1ce5ac1fc1')
