   $q$How does the exchange "Was that there all along?" and "All along" shape the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It stresses that the stars never changed; what changed was Davi's willingness to wait.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that Davi is embarrassed and wants to leave the park immediately.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"It suggests that the ranger has secretly been turning the stars on and off.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It reveals that Ana had seen the Milky Way before but kept it from Davi.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It stresses that the stars never changed; what changed was Davi's willingness to wait.$q$, $q$The ranger confirms the stars were always there, so the difference came from Davi's patience in the dark. His question shows wonder, not embarrassment, since he "sat up" to look.$q$, 'draft', '576c8f54-4019-50d7-a1f0-4eae061a95b0')
